  "body": "## Changelog\n\n- 891839e Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master'\n- 8dd80e7 Used default GH token.\n- 0deffb5 Merge pull request #796 from jonbullock/release/2.7.0\n- 342ea53 Updated version for release.\n- d6198fb Merge pull request #791 from jbake-org/fix/gh-actions\n- 61a12e3 chore: use gradle action for cache\n- d3a21e3 chore: upgrade github actions version\n- faa0c6c chore: upgrade github actions version\n- 5921ee5 Reverted to SNAPSHOT suffix.\n\n\n## Contributors\nWe'd like to thank the following people for their contributions:\n- Manik Magar ([@manikmagar](https://github.com/manikmagar))\n- Jonathan Bullock ([@jonbullock](https://github.com/jonbullock))\n- Frank Becker ([@a8](https://github.com/a8))",
